&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in open source&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Grafana, Tableau or other analysis/BI tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Salesforce CPQ, Zuora, or other CPQ / Q2C / subscription management tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with marketing automation (Marketo) or sales productivity tools (Outreach, Clari, People.ai).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with SQL or similar database querying language (you won’t be deep in SQL, but helps to have heard of a LEFT JOIN).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying generative AI, predictive analytics, or AI-enabled automation to improve GTM planning, forecasting, and reporting, with sound judgment in validating outputs and underlying assumptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
