&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Commercial (Growth) — expanding Grafana usage within existing mid-market customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Commercial (Acquisition) — landing net-new commercial logos&lt;/li&gt;
