ster, and optimize telemetry at scale. Built on open source and open standards and designed for interoperability across any stack, Grafana Cloud brings AI to observability and observability to AI, giving teams (and their agents) unified visibility so they can see, understand, and act on all their disparate data, wherever it lives, and move at the speed of their ambitions. Customers, including Anthropic, Bloomberg, NVIDIA, Microsoft, and Salesforce, rely on Grafana Labs. We are a 100% remote company with team members across 40+ countries, backed by leading investors including Lightspeed Venture Partners, Sequoia Capital, GIC, Coatue, J.P. Morgan, CapitalG, and Lead Edge Capital. Learn more at &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://grafana.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;grafana.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and follow us on &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/grafana-labs/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt; and &lt;u&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/grafana&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re scaling fast and staying true to what makes us different: an open-source legacy, a global collaborative culture, and a passion for meaningful work. Our team thrives in an innovation-driven environment where transparency, autonomy, and trust fuel everything we do.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You may not meet every requirement, and that’s okay. If this role excites you, we’d love you to raise your hand for what could be a truly career-defining opportunity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regional Marketing Associate supports the execution of regional marketing plans across AMER, working with all Regional Marketing Managers to deliver programs based on team priorities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own assigned programs and tasks from setup through post-event reporting, using established playbooks, processes, and templates. Your manager will set priorities in partnership with the Regional Marketing Managers. You will be responsible for delivering accurate, high-quality work on time, asking for guidance when needed, and flagging risks early.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will use AI and data tools daily to improve efficiency and inform your work, while remaining accountable for the accuracy and quality of everything you deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execute programs across AMER.&lt;/strong&gt; Support all Regional Marketing Managers by delivering assigned events, campaigns and ABM activities using established playbooks, from setup through follow-up. Your manager will set priorities in partnership with the Regional Marketing Managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manage program operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Build registration pages, emails, landing pages and campaign workflows in the team’s tools. Coordinate paid social execution, vendors and logistics as assigned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ensure quality before launch.&lt;/strong&gt; Review event setup, assets, emails and landing pages for accuracy, completeness and functionality before they go live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Report on results.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain accurate program data, track agreed metrics and prepare post-event and campaign reports using standard tools and templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep the team informed.&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain timelines and task status in Monday.com, and proactively communicate progress and changes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support budget operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Track program expenses, manage purchase orders and coordinate invoices with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use AI and improve processes.&lt;/strong&gt; Apply AI and data tools daily to work more efficiently, validate outputs and share useful workflows and process improvements with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flag issues early.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring risks, blockers, unclear requirements and competing requests to your manager early so priorities and next steps can be resolved.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll bring at this level:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Located in EST or CST&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years in field marketing, regional marketing or events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organization and close attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with, or fast ramp on, Splash, Zuddl, Salesforce and Monday.com&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI and the judgment to validate its output&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel approximately 40%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Rewards:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the US, the Compensation range for this role is&amp;nbsp; $88,000 - $92,000. Actual compensation may vary based on level, experience, and skillset as assessed throughout the interview process. All of our roles include Restricted Stock Units (RSUs), giving every team member ownership in Grafana Labs&#39; success. We believe in shared outcomes—RSUs help us stay aligned and invested as we scale globally.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;
